<item><title>Ouaddaï agencies train about 50 young people in digital skills</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/ouaddai-agencies-train-about-50-young-people-in-digital-d64f2f/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/ouaddai-agencies-train-about-50-young-people-in-digital-d64f2f/</guid><category>Chad</category><description>The four-day course in Abéché covers computing, artificial intelligence and responsible use of social media.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 21:58:58 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" length="30806" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Chad launches housing plan as N&apos;Djamena adds 20 000 households a year</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-launches-housing-plan-as-n-djamena-adds-20-000-3ff727/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-launches-housing-plan-as-n-djamena-adds-20-000-3ff727/</guid><category>Chad</category><description>The government&apos;s new programme targets homes and serviced plots, while the ministry says it will stop allocating undeveloped land.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 21:48:27 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-launches-housing-plan-as-n-djamena-adds-20-000-3ff727/share.jpg" length="42096" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-launches-housing-plan-as-n-djamena-adds-20-000-3ff727/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Chad&apos;s prime minister faces parliamentary questioning on 30 November</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-s-prime-minister-faces-parliamentary-questioning-on-30-be7df1/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-s-prime-minister-faces-parliamentary-questioning-on-30-be7df1/</guid><category>Chad</category><description>Deputy Mahamat Ahmat Lazina initiated the plenary-session questioning, whose official subject has not yet been announced.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 21:10:16 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" length="30806" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Chad group launches CFA155.56 million drive to revive science classes in Wadi Fira</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-group-launches-cfa155-56-million-drive-to-revive-3161af/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-group-launches-cfa155-56-million-drive-to-revive-3161af/</guid><category>Chad</category><description>The three-year programme targets teacher shortages and the lack of science streams, with CFA46.75 million allocated for 2026-2027.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 20:14:11 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" length="30806" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Chad names Daouda Ahmat Mahamat to head N&apos;Djaména university</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-names-daouda-ahmat-mahamat-to-head-n-djamena-university-247c18/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-names-daouda-ahmat-mahamat-to-head-n-djamena-university-247c18/</guid><category>Chad</category><description>A 20 November presidential decree installs the professor in place of Mahamat Saleh Daoussa Haggar, who was suspended from the post.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 19:12:05 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" length="30806" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
